{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoilAnnihilation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoilAnnihilation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoilRootEval"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.instStrongAJTrefoilOfCharZero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.instStrongAJTrefoilOfCharZero","kind":"instance","line":492,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoilAnnihilation.lean#L492-L504","doc":"**Strong AJ for the trefoil — fully proved.**  The annihilation\nroutes through the assembled case-split proof; the two root-of-unity\nevaluation cores (`trefoil_eval_at_root_prev`/`_next`) are discharged\nby `QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoilRootEval`, so no `sorry` remains anywhere\nin the trefoil strong-AJ chain. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trefoilOperator_annihilates","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trefoilOperator_annihilates","kind":"theorem","line":274,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoilAnnihilation.lean#L274-L486","doc":"**The trefoil annihilation, assembled** — for every `w ≠ 0`, via the\ncase split of the module docstring.  The generic case is the\n[C1]/[C2] computation; the degenerate colors route through the two\ncited evaluation cores. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trefoil_eval_at_root_next","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trefoil_eval_at_root_next","kind":"theorem","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoilAnnihilation.lean#L196-L225","doc":"**Evaluation core C (proved): root-of-unity periodicity, next slot.**\nWhen `(w⁴)^{N+1} = 1` (but `w⁴ ≠ 1`) the tower value at color `N` is\nexactly `1`.  Proved via the offset root evaluation\n`trP_sum_at_root_offset` (`QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoilRootEval`);\nnumerically pre-verified to 40 dps ([C core]). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trefoil_eval_at_root_prev","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trefoil_eval_at_root_prev","kind":"theorem","line":165,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoilAnnihilation.lean#L165-L194","doc":"**Evaluation core B (proved): root-of-unity periodicity of the\nRosso–Jones sum, previous slot.**  When `(w⁴)^N = 1` (but `w⁴ ≠ 1`)\nthe tower value at the NEXT color is exactly `1` — the surviving term\nof the annihilation at the degenerate color `x = 1`.  Proved via the\nroot evaluation `trP_sum_at_root_self`\n(`QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoilRootEval`: reflection + shift +\nGauss-sum collapse); numerically pre-verified to 40 dps in\n`computations/aj_trefoil_telescope_assembly_check.py` [B core]. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.coloredJonesTrefoil_eq_P_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.coloredJonesTrefoil_eq_P_form","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoilAnnihilation.lean#L81-L134","doc":"**P-form of the tower** (pure rearrangement, holds for every\n`w ≠ 0` — no denominator hypotheses):\n`J(n+1) = (−1)^n (w^{6n(n+2)})⁻¹ P(n) / [n+1]_{w²}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trP_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trP_succ","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoilAnnihilation.lean#L61-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJTrefoil.trP","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJTrefoilAnnihilation.lean#L54-L59","doc":"Signed cyclotomic partial sum of the Rosso–Jones tower:\n`P(n) = ∑_{j≤n} (−1)^j w^{6j(j+1)} [2j+1]_{w²}` — all exponents are\n`ℕ`-powers. ","signatureChunk":0}]}